      <h>135</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>F11 | UC12-UC13 | Deterministic metadata statistics and optional AI review are separate requests.
Calls use Section 3 operations; argument names denote values of the declared parameter types.
Solid filled arrows: synchronous calls. Dashed open arrows: returns. Actor messages: UI actions, not Java APIs.
GUI shown; PhotoPilotCLI uses the same PhotoPilotFacade and exposed service references.
fontsize=18
bg=#F2F6FA</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
