  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>95</x>
      <y>7505</y>
      <w>1050</w>
      <h>78</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>The in-memory candidate aggregate is not published on a failed write. Persistence failure never
reports a saved review or completed transition; the persisted completed session remains the base.
fontsize=17
bg=#FFFBEF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>95</x>
      <y>7683</y>
      <w>1050</w>
      <h>150</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>UC12 saves only successful validated summaries with usable metadata. No-data/invalid results do not
overwrite saved statistics; failed atomic writes preserve the stored session. UC13 retrieves the
associated statistics through find(id). The EXIF library API remains unspecified; boundary messages
describe adapter behavior, not invented Java operations.
fontsize=17
bg=#FFFBEF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
